## Summary

The `deleteChat` action in `src/store/chats.js` has been enhanced with three key additions:

1. **Panel Removal** - Removes Desktop panels for each deleted chat ID using `$storex.views.removePanelFromDesktop(id)`
2. **App Closure** - Closes associated open apps using `$storex.ui.closeApp(app)` to sync UI state
3. **Safe Error Handling** - Wrapped in try-catch to prevent one panel failure from blocking the entire deletion

The solution maintains backward compatibility and properly handles chat hierarchies (parent + descendants).

